{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "如《慈恩傳》"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "筆談"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "且小乘亦知有他方佛，但謂一佛各化一方，而不知十方諸佛悉是\n釋迦分身，謂無它佛之談。此乃四明答楊大年書語。"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "合論\n引"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "陰即果也"}
{"id": null, "n": null, "target": null, "type": null, "text": "平聲"}
{"id": null, "n": "0635001", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0635001", "type": "orig", "text": "（金剛經五十三家註(No. 468)，第24卷所収。󴦒）"}
{"id": null, "n": "0635002", "target": "#nkr_note_orig_0635002", "type": "orig", "text": "（嘉泰普燈錄卷三十(No. 1559)，第79卷所収。󴦒）"}
